        206.64781188964844,
        536.8571166992188
      ],
      "text": "revention of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        545.5999145507812,
        513.4605102539062,
        558.951416015625
      ],
      "text": "Global efforts to control the co-epidemics of TB and HIV will benefit children. They",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        561.5963745117188,
        513.4375,
        574.9478759765625
      ],
      "text": "include the expansion of PMTCT programmes, which will reduce the number of new",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        577.5928955078125,
        513.4833984375,
        590.9443969726562
      ],
      "text": "HIV infections in young children. However, additional specific strategies are needed. As",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        593.5894165039062,
        513.4490966796875,
        606.94091796875
      ],
      "text": "a minimum, all children living with HIV should be screened for TB and all children (and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        609.5859375,
        513.4261474609375,
        622.9374389648438
      ],
      "text": "their families) with TB should be offered HIV testing and counselling in settings of high",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        625.5134887695312,
        180.04090881347656,
        638.9339599609375
      ],
      "text": "(1) HIV prevalence .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        650.0889282226562,
        513.3683471679688,
        663.4404296875
      ],
      "text": "Irrespective of age, all children living with HIV who are household contacts of infectious",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        666.08544921875,
        513.4144287109375,
        679.4369506835938
      ],
      "text": "TB cases should be evaluated for TB disease and either treated for TB or given preventive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        682.0819702148438,
        491.66790771484375,
        695.4334716796875
      ],
      "text": "therapy if screening finds that they are unlikely to have TB disease (see Chapter 5).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        706.5884399414062,
        513.3800048828125,
        719.93994140625
      ],
      "text": "Innovative approaches are needed to ensure that co-infected children are identified",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        722.5849609375,
        513.3800659179688,
        735.9364624023438
      ],
      "text": "and that, where possible, disease is prevented. This requires integration of services",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        738.5814208984375,
        513.448974609375,
        751.9329223632812
      ],
      "text": "and collaborative TB/HIV activities by national TB and HIV programmes as well as other",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
